<title>RUSSIA: Management change seen at top Norilsk unit - agency.</title>
<headline>Management change seen at top Norilsk unit - agency.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Russia metals producer AO Norilsk Nickel has suspended the head of its main unit, Leonid Galperin, and will probably appoint a new management team by the end of the month, Interfax news agency said on Friday.</p>
